[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17521.91, "timestamp": "04:52:01", "text": "已离开服务器的版主。我希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17525.51, "timestamp": "04:52:05", "text": "呃，把我拉黑了，或者嗯，哦，是的。我不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17527.83, "timestamp": "04:52:07", "text": "之前就讨论过这个问题。不，我们得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17529.35, "timestamp": "04:52:09", "text": "跑题了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17532.55, "timestamp": "04:52:12", "text": "所以，在戏剧发生之后或者戏剧发生期间，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17535.03, "timestamp": "04:52:15", "text": "有人被告知要屏蔽我，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17536.23, "timestamp": "04:52:16", "text": "东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17539.35, "timestamp": "04:52:19", "text": "那些和他们一起去的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17541.99, "timestamp": "04:52:21", "text": "他们的宣传活动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17545.91, "timestamp": "04:52:25", "text": "现在，大多数人都关注了我或者喜欢我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17548.47, "timestamp": "04:52:28", "text": "现在他把我从好友列表里删除了，因为我有Discord账号。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17551.27, "timestamp": "04:52:31", "text": "隐私设置，除非我添加"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17553.83, "timestamp": "04:52:33", "text": "他们作为朋友，不能给我发消息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17556.39, "timestamp": "04:52:36", "text": "正确的？我不得不这样做，因为有很多……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17560.31, "timestamp": "04:52:40", "text": "准社交观看者。这是因为就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17563.75, "timestamp": "04:52:43", "text": "我既是朋友，也像个调解人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17567.91, "timestamp": "04:52:47", "text": "或者像个模组，你管那个头叫什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17572.07, "timestamp": "04:52:52", "text": "公司虚拟管道的模组"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17575.43, "timestamp": "04:52:55", "text": "公司现在的任务就像 Discord 一样，很多时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17579.27, "timestamp": "04:52:59", "text": "很多人都想成为朋友"}]